                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. Minecraft: The Wild Update (Original Game Soundtrack)" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="曲目“Ancestry”虽然也于22w16a或基岩版1.19.0.26与本专辑其他歌曲一同加入，但包含在专辑Minecraft: Caves &amp; Cliffs (Original Game Soundtrack)中，而非本专辑。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 红石中继器" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="只有底座顶面的纹理是红石中继器自身独有的。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 上锁的箱子" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="上锁的箱子可能会在半空中或者在树顶上生成。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
